{{Short description|Heads of state of Sinchew}}
This is a list of the presidents of [[Sinchew]]. The office is established by the [[Constitution of Sinchew]] of 1733, and the president is elected by the [[General Assembly of Sinchew|General Assembly]] for a term of four years.

